{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01219",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 5.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Morning, uh, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.46,
      "end_seconds": 11.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.2,
      "end_seconds": 19.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Mm, I've been dealing with pain on the outside of my elbow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.21,
      "end_seconds": 22.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.07,
      "end_seconds": 33.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.01,
      "end_seconds": 53.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, pulse is 85 beats a minute. And pressure 121 over 82, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.11,
      "end_seconds": 60.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.25,
      "end_seconds": 69.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "So, they help me see the whole picture, more shortly. How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.98,
      "end_seconds": 78.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "About... well, about two weeks. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.16,
      "end_seconds": 82.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.34,
      "end_seconds": 87.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I get some relief from rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.04,
      "end_seconds": 91.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.16,
      "end_seconds": 107.28,
      "duration_seconds": 15.12,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a weaker grip as well. Okay, so the weaker grip? That's been since Monday. Erm, about weaker grip, about a six out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.75,
      "end_seconds": 128.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "A few quick ones: neck pain or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.21,
      "end_seconds": 133.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "No, no neck pain or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.49,
      "end_seconds": 135.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Hm, okay. What about swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.81,
      "end_seconds": 140.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.8,
      "end_seconds": 144.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.6,
      "end_seconds": 147.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.29,
      "end_seconds": 151.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.48,
      "end_seconds": 155.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.8,
      "end_seconds": 161.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Right, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.8,
      "end_seconds": 168.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.21,
      "end_seconds": 183.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.5,
      "end_seconds": 187.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.81,
      "end_seconds": 191.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.76,
      "end_seconds": 195.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Nothing regular, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.46,
      "end_seconds": 202.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.89,
      "end_seconds": 206.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.56,
      "end_seconds": 212.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.23,
      "end_seconds": 228.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.45,
      "end_seconds": 233.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.3,
      "end_seconds": 250.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.24,
      "end_seconds": 252.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.41,
      "end_seconds": 271.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "It's tender over the bony point on the outside, and it hurts when I resist your wrist going up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.83,
      "end_seconds": 282.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "So, that's the examination finished. So where does that leave us? My working impression is tennis elbow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.72,
      "end_seconds": 286.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.2,
      "end_seconds": 296.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's tennis elbow, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.6,
      "end_seconds": 338.55,
      "duration_seconds": 22.95,
      "text": "Rest it, use a forearm strap and do the stretches I'll show you. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Let's plan a check if it is not better in six weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.47,
      "end_seconds": 342.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}